                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Repeating audo cues when you go between rooms. There is no soundtrack, just loud bangs that keep repeating when you cross specific rooms. It's a point and click and I barely want to room transition because the noise is awful. For the game itself it was nothing special, and the UI is really buggy and unfriendly to use. Items don't have names; I picked up a doorknob apparently, but it looked like a candy or something.\nGame crashed at final cutscene. There's not much positive at all that I was left with after playing this.",
